es coming soon!\n\n*While the mod was originally created for personal use, it is publicly available, and more features are planned for future updates.*\n*Stay tuned as this mod continues to grow with more unique integrations and utilities!*\n\n## Current features\n\n### Road creation system\n\nPlace Road Nodes on the ground where you have roads.\n\nInteract a Road Node with a Road Connector to begin linking, interact another Road Node to finish linking.\n\nDestroy Road Nodes to unlink.\n\nInteract and sneak on a Road Node to get information of the node.\n\n### Export to Open Street Map (OSM)\n\nUse the command `/sams_transport osm_export \u003Cdimension>` to export the road network to an OSM XML file.\n\nUse your favourite OSM tools for rendering the OSM XML file.\n\n## Upcoming features\n\n- [ ] : Vehicle systems **(In Progress)**\n    - [ ] : Automated vehicles\n    - [ ] : Player driven vehicles **(In Progress)**\n\n## License\n\nSam's Bits - Extra stuff that I want for the Create mod and Minecraft.\nCopyright (C) 2024  Samuel Hulme\n\nThis program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify\nit under the terms of the GNU Affero General Public License as published\nby the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or\n(at your option) any later version.\n\nThis program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\nbut WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of\nMERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\nGNU Affero General Public License for more details.\n\nYou should have received a copy of the GNU Affero General Public License\nalong with this program.  If not, see \u003Chttps://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\n\nFor more information view the full [./LICENSE](./LICENSE).\n","2024-10-09T18:44:07.889066Z","2024-12-31T17:33:21.307926Z","2024-10-12T05:42:44.650138Z","2024-10-09T19:03:11.785951Z",{"id":30667,"name":30668,"url":30669},"AGPL-3.0-only","GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only","https://github.com/ajh123/Sams-Bits/blob/main/LICENSE",835,[134,297,303],[30,288],[346,354],[30675,30676,30677,30678,30679],"B5ckwXVl","OB3d109I","9rRopaQZ","KI9ZGbIa","HmOi0a6n","https://github.com/ajh123/Sams-Bits/issues","https://github.com/ajh123/Sams-Bits",[],[],"oaLtz6ce",{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29934,"game_versions":30686,"id":30687,"slug":30688,"project_type":12,"team":30689,"organization":3604,"title":30690,"description":30691,"body":30692,"body_url":3604,"published":30693,"updated":30694,"approved":30695,"queued":30696,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":30697,"downloads":30699,"followers":30063,"categories":30700,"additional_categories":30701,"loaders":30702,"versions":30703,"icon_url":30705,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":3604,"donation_urls":30706,"gallery":30707,"color":30713,"thread_id":30714,"monetization_status":29963},[859,853,805,802,772,724,682,673,667],"Os8ft2Ql","mini-shield","CejKEL0L","mini shield","mini shield better than vanilla shield","The Small Shield pack significantly reduces the shield's size on your screen. While the standard shield blocks your vision, this pack provides a wider field of view, allowing you to see your opponents and surroundings clearly. Better visibility helps you react faster during PvP and maximizes your overall gaming performance. Gain a massive advantage in both combat and exploration with this essential utility pack!","2026-02-16T14:54:41.672180Z","2026-02-20T15:14:34.614708Z","2026-03-09T04:12:26.070086Z","2026-02-20T15:14:38.617792Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":30698},"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT",1912,[],[],[377],[30704],"dBMCEiRi","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os8ft2Ql/b688ec39d2456e0b01d521227f600c8f9b821f00.jpeg",[],[30708],{"url":30709,"raw_url":30710,"featured":861,"title":30711,"description":3604,"created":30712,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os8ft2Ql/images/82be2a4400e74dada0541fbe3105f6515e978c7b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os8ft2Ql/images/82be2a4400e74dada0541fbe3105f6515e978c7b.png","shield","2026-02-20T14:31:19.142451Z",7684133,"ajaoAKRi",{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29935,"game_versions":30716,"id":30717,"slug":30718,"project_type":34,"team":30719,"organization":3604,"title":30720,"description":30721,"body":30722,"body_url":3604,"published":30723,"updated":30724,"approved":30725,"queued":30726,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":30727,"downloads":30728,"followers":29950,"categories":30729,"additional_categories":30730,"loaders":30731,"versions":30732,"icon_url":30734,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":30735,"donation_urls":30736,"gallery":30737,"color":30748,"thread_id":30749,"monetization_status":30750},[1055],"OsI4Ewyq","create-bedos-factory","SR4IwLJh","Create: Bedo's Factory","A tech and automation modpack built around the Create mod, specially optimized for lower-end systems to let you design and build massive automated factories without lag.","Welcome to Create: Bedo's Factory!\n\nAre you ready to dive into the world of industrial automation? Create: Bedo's Factory is a carefully curated modpack designed for those who love mechanical engineering, complex production lines, and endless creativity. Built around the amazing Create mod, this pack offers a balanced and immersive experience for players who want to build the factory of their dreams.\n\nWhy choose this pack?\n\nFocus on Automation: From simple farms to massive, self-sustaining industrial complexes, you have all the tools you need to automate everything.\n\nPerformance-Optimized: We’ve included essential optimization mods like Embeddium and ModernFix to ensure your game runs smoothly, even with complex machines running.\n\nEnhanced Experience: With added content from Create add-ons and various utility mods, your building process will be more efficient and enjoyable.\n\nThis pack is all about the joy of engineering. Whether you are a beginner looking to understand the basics of kinetic energy or an expert builder aiming to construct the most complex contraptions, there is something here for you. Start small, expand your operations, and watch your factory come to life!\n\nBuilding Factories, Having Fun! Note: This pack is updated regularly. Please make sure to report any issues you encounter so we can continue improving your experience.","2026-06-17T14:59:26.584600Z","2026-06-24T14:32:59.550559Z","2026-06-24T21:11:31.327923Z","2026-06-24T14:34:41.507782Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":3604},20,[211,288],[],[354],[30733],"IiHF9hAZ","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsI4Ewyq/3b718cd0f2eee00c9e6a418ce35dc306a98fd03e_96.webp","https://discord.gg/5szMWmA6",[],[30738,30744],{"url":30739,"raw_url":30740,"featured":439,"title":30741,"description":30742,"created":30743,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsI4Ewyq/images/184bd1774bacf3446a22bbfcfbf07a04240dd790_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsI4Ewyq/images/184bd1774bacf3446a22bbfcfbf07a04240dd790.png","CREATE BEDO`S FACTORY","CREATE FACTORY\n","2026-06-17T15:26:05.036380Z",{"url":30745,"raw_url":30746,"featured":439,"title":30741,"description":3604,"created":30747,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsI4Ewyq/images/3b718cd0f2eee00c9e6a418ce35dc306a98fd03e_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsI4Ewyq/images/3b718cd0f2eee00c9e6a418ce35dc306a98fd03e.png","2026-06-17T15:27:22.497620Z",2365454,"PnHOxDCL","demonetized",{"client_side":29934,"server_side":29935,"game_versions":30752,"id":30753,"slug":30754,"project_type":31,"team":30755,"organization":3604,"title":30756,"description":30757,"body":30758,"body_url":3604,"published":30759,"updated":30760,"approved":30761,"queued":30762,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":30763,"downloads":30764,"followers":30063,"categories":30765,"additional_categories":30766,"loaders":30767,"versions":30768,"icon_url":3604,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":3604,"donation_urls":30774,"gallery":30775,"color":3604,"thread_id":30781,"monetization_status":29963},[859,853,805,802,772,724,682,673,667,622,616,571,517,511,499],"OricQykT","mobarmybattle","SPzqkYgP","MobArmyBattle","Two teams collect mobs and later fight each other’s mobs in arena-based waves, with the fastest team winning. (inspired by BastiGHG)","This plugin was inspired by German youtuber BastiGHG [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46V4KpWCPJA](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46V4KpWCPJA),\nyou have 2 teams, which first kill as many mobs as they can to collect them.\n\nThen in \"arenas\", each team fights against the mobs, the other team has defeated in multiple waves.\n\n## Setup\n\n### 1. Team configuration\n\n- Use `/mbteam add \u003Cteam> \u003Cplayer>` to add a player to a team; (permission: `mb.team` or op) (team can be either `1` or `2`)\n\n**NOTE:** *the first player added to the team will later configure the waves.*\n\n### 2. Collecting mobs\n\n- Use `/start HH:MM:SS` (e.g. `/start 00:30:00` for 30 minutes) to start the collection phase.; (permission: `mb.timer` or op)\n- Each team has a backpack, that can be opened with `/bp`\n\n### 3. Selecting Waves\n\n- The first player of each team will see a GUI, where you can assign the mobs you collected to the 4 waves.\n\n**NOTE:** *if you accidentally closed the wave config UI, you can reopen it with `/waveconf`* \n\n### 4. Fighting\n\n- After both teams configured their waves, someone who is either op or has the permission `mb.team`, can type `/ready`\n- You will then fight against the waves, all mobs will have the glowing effect\n- The team that finishes first wins\n\n**NOTE:** *`/ready` will assume BOTH teams are ready, and teleport everyone, it should only be typed once* ","2026-02-08T19:00:53.388507Z","2026-04-18T13:24:32.624730Z","2026-02-11T01:18:27.237944Z","2026-02-11T07:09:52.119385Z",{"id":30061,"name":10,"url":3604},183,[134,185],[191