lobal nbt rules.\n\nNote for resource packs creators: `nbt.ExtraAttributes` is automagically mapped to the `minecraft:custom_data` component.","2024-09-09T05:49:14.012299Z","2024-09-28T17:53:05.896158Z","2024-09-12T04:41:59.643578Z","2024-09-10T12:01:55.215671Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":30833},"https://github.com/SHsuperCM/CITResewn/blob/main/LICENSE",1023518,18,[303],[],[346],[30840,30841],"TbnPpvor","bM1zYJHO","https://github.com/GrahamKracker/CITResewn",[],[],"R2t69Xd4",{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29935,"game_versions":30847,"id":30848,"slug":30849,"project_type":31,"team":30850,"organization":3604,"title":30851,"description":30852,"body":30853,"body_url":3604,"published":30854,"updated":30855,"approved":30856,"queued":30857,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":30858,"downloads":30859,"followers":29950,"categories":30860,"additional_categories":30861,"loaders":30862,"versions":30863,"icon_url":30867,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":3604,"donation_urls":30868,"gallery":30869,"color":30879,"thread_id":30880,"monetization_status":29963},[1055],"OqeKHWdz","armband","5witl05Y","Armband","This is a simple armband mod for team games.","This is a simple mod for armbands that allows you to differentiate people by team, perfect for team games. I hope you find this mod useful someday. Attention! This mod uses the Curios API to work, so if it doesn't work for you, download this mod.","2026-03-31T19:07:20.877895Z","2026-04-04T11:02:53.477085Z","2026-04-03T06:24:34.192582Z","2026-04-02T16:04:38.334082Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":3604},133,[115],[],[354],[30864,30865,30866],"HOwbKd7V","sOVhbbZm","3us2Gw9T","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OqeKHWdz/20ed926af770ec2f5b490fcc5fd51f425cded3de.png",[],[30870,30873,30876],{"url":30871,"raw_url":30871,"featured":439,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":30872,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OqeKHWdz/images/a880d48162ad7de3dd03e7d5e3e77882019d1516.png","2026-04-03T08:19:46.820106Z",{"url":30874,"raw_url":30874,"featured":439,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":30875,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OqeKHWdz/images/bd0be55107e10155b8288c86fb5c06961960fa84.png","2026-04-03T08:19:40.996139Z",{"url":30877,"raw_url":30877,"featured":439,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":30878,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OqeKHWdz/images/ff73e3f6626db8df3dd87fabe9e3c4af1558bd2e.png","2026-04-03T08:19:54.597019Z",4987932,"wdRes9EB",{"client_side":29934,"server_side":29935,"game_versions":30882,"id":30883,"slug":30884,"project_type":31,"team":30885,"organization":3604,"title":30886,"description":30887,"body":30888,"body_url":3604,"published":30889,"updated":30890,"approved":30891,"queued":30892,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":30893,"downloads":30894,"followers":30895,"categories":30896,"additional_categories":30897,"loaders":30898,"versions":30899,"icon_url":30902,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":30903,"donation_urls":30904,"gallery":30905,"color":30910,"thread_id":30911,"monetization_status":29963},[1226,1193,1184,1148,1109,1061,1055,1022,980,974,902,896,859,853,805,802,772,724,682,673,667,622,616,571,517,511],"Or1zeMZU","veinminer-ultra","FCMvffg2","VeinMiner Ultra","A smart, lightweight, and multi-version compatible VeinMiner  plugin that allows players to seamlessly mine entire veins of ores in a single break.","## ENGLİSH 🇬🇧\n\n## ⛏️ What is VeinMiner Ultra?\nThis plugin is a powerful, lightweight, and server-friendly system that allows players to break ore veins of the same type with a single hit. It saves time and makes mining much more enjoyable!\n\n## ⚙️ How Does it Work?\nWhen a player breaks a configured ore (e.g., iron ore) using a pickaxe, all adjacent blocks of the same type are automatically detected and broken. The plugin uses a smart **BFS (Breadth-First Search)** algorithm to scan connected blocks. To prevent server lag, the maximum number of blocks broken at once is limited to 64.\n\n## ✨ Key Features:\n* **🛠️ Anti-Lag System:** The total XP accumulated from the broken blocks is merged into a single XP orb, completely eliminating lag issues.\n* **🌐 Wide Version Support:** Developed directly using the standard Spigot API, containing no NMS code. This ensures flawless performance across versions **1.19 - 1.21+**.\n* **🚀 Server-Friendly:** Optimized to preserve your server's performance, even when instantly breaking dozens of blocks.\n\n## 💬 **You can join my Discord server for suggestions and complaints.**\n\n## TURKISH 🇹🇷\n\n## ⛏️ VeinMiner Ultra Nedir?\nBu plugin, oyuncuların aynı türdeki maden gruplarını (damarlarını) tek bir vuruşta kırmasını sağlayan güçlü, hafif ve sunucu dostu bir sistemdir. Zaman tasarrufu sağlar ve madencili çok daha keyifli hale getirir!\n\n## ⚙️ Nasıl Çalışır?\nOyuncu, kazma kullanarak belirlenmiş bir madeni (örneğin demir cevheri) kırdığında, ona bitişik olan aynı türdeki tüm bloklar da otomatik olarak tespit edilip kırılır. Eklenti, blokları taramak için akıllı **BFS (Genişlik Öncelikli Arama)** algoritması kullanır. Sunucuda gecikmeye (lag) neden olmamak için tek seferde kırılacak blok sayısı 64 blok ile sınırlandırılmıştır.\n\n## ✨ Öne Çıkan Özellikler:\n* **🛠️ Lag Önleyici Sistem:** Kırılan bloklardan gelecek toplam Xp tek bir Xp küresi altında toplanarak lag sorununu ortadan kaldırır.\n* **🌐 Geniş Sürüm Desteği:** Doğrudan standart Spigot API kullanılarak geliştirilmiştir, NMS kodu içermez. Bu sayede **1.19 - 1.21+** sürümleri arasında hatasız bir şekilde çalışır.\n* **🚀 Sunucu Dostu:** Onlarca bloğu anında kırarken bile sunucu performansınızı koruyacak şekilde optimize edilmiştir.\n\n## 💬 **Öneri ve şikayetleriniz için Discord sunucuma katılabilirsiniz.**","2026-03-28T14:31:49.250630Z","2026-04-04T21:03:31.709126Z","2026-03-29T05:13:22.409982Z","2026-03-28T17:18:59.541362Z",{"id":30061,"name":10,"url":3604},280,5,[115,134,303],[],[329,401,405,417],[30900,30901],"7VBKWeVl","YxMu1KbX","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or1zeMZU/698665afd0ea5c1ada686124f46e439edc8c31fb_96.webp","https://discord.gg/m7TnKXV9cx",[],[30906],{"url":30907,"raw_url":30907,"featured":439,"title":30908,"description":3604,"created":30909,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or1zeMZU/images/ec7060b6a696975eb048c3fd0d3806dc7efebe4b.gif","How does the plugin work?","2026-03-28T17:16:55.871288Z",3292490,"xnMzQx7K",{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29934,"game_versions":30913,"id":30914,"slug":30915,"project_type":12,"team":30916,"organization":3604,"title":30917,"description":30918,"body":30919,"body_url":3604,"published":30920,"updated":30921,"approved":30922,"queued":30923,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":30924,"downloads":30925,"followers":30926,"categories":30927,"additional_categories":30928,"loaders":30929,"versions":30930,"icon_url":30932,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":3604,"donation_urls":30933,"gallery":30934,"color":30946,"thread_id":30947,"monetization_status":29963},[2780,2753,2750,2711,2687,2684,2681,2678,2648,2546,2528,2504,2501,2495,2492,2489,2486,2483,2348],"Or7JWpp6","aerox-16x","gzzSXkNx","AEROX PVP 16x","A 1.8/1.7 16x clean pvp texture pack","# AEROX PVP 16x\n\nAEROX is a 16x PVP oriented texture that I released on the occasion of hitting 100 subscribers (a while back now). The pack was made for 1.8 and 1.7 combat in mind (duels, bedwars, etc.)\n\nThe pack retextures most blocks and items, there is a however a focus on PVP items (swords, armor, wool, buckets, etc.) Most items in bedwars or skywars will have been modified by the texture pack. It features smaller swords and is purple themed. The pack works well with optifine or just plain vanilla.\n\nI personally really like this pack for its attention to detail and its purple accent. Overall, it's a go-to PVP pack!\n\nHere's the link to the [showcase video](https://youtu.be/-l0kqxHoYHE): \n\n.\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/-l0kqxHoYHE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>","2024-09-19T20:59:24.934474Z","2024-09-19T21:10:12.703083Z","2024-10-01T19:36:06.176999Z","2024-09-30T02:24:04.223776Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":3604},49573,22,[15,77,268],[57,110,113,115,128,139,148,300],[377],[30931],"uTUWejqp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or7JWpp6/d7ac66587b231dce82cca7977cf58a88770d5c1f.png",[],[30935,30938,30942],{"url":30936,"raw_url":30936,"featured":861,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":30937,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or7JWpp6/images/12fbfbbb91b2613959a9feb9867bd3c0c165eb70.webp","2024-09-19T21:10:39.198949Z",{"url":30939,"raw_url":30940,"featured":439,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":30941,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or7JWpp6/images/411e1732437544016eef5730922a678ca3862879_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or7JWpp6/images/411e1732437544016eef5730922a678ca3862879.png","2024-09-19T21:12:58.681865Z",{"url":30943,"raw_url":30944,"featured":439,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":30945,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or7JWpp6/images/e6475660b4c5d2e68b3e2039a580efd90382a692_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or7JWpp6/images/e6475660b4c5d2e68b3e2039a580efd90382a692.png","2024-09-19T21:12:47.568667Z",1513239,"BimqaH81",{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29934,"game_versions":30949,"id":30950,"slug":30951,"project_type":12,"team":30952,"organization":3604,"title":30953,"description":30954,"body":30955,"body_url":3604,"published":30956,"updated":30957,"approved":30958,"queued":30959,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":30960,"downloads":30961,"followers":30063,"categories":3