4b357e32aeb8c74efdd.png","Splash Image","2024-10-16T12:47:42.965365Z",3152912,"dVklDTeW",{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29934,"game_versions":31043,"id":31044,"slug":31045,"project_type":12,"team":31046,"organization":3604,"title":31047,"description":31048,"body":31049,"body_url":3604,"published":31050,"updated":31051,"approved":31052,"queued":31053,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":31054,"downloads":31057,"followers":31058,"categories":31059,"additional_categories":31060,"loaders":31061,"versions":31062,"icon_url":31064,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":3604,"donation_urls":31065,"gallery":31066,"color":31099,"thread_id":31044,"monetization_status":29963},[1940,1916,1907,1790,1781,1766,1751,1727,1658,1652,1643,1553,1550,1520,1514,1502,1481,1406,1388,1325,1310,1283,1226,1193,1184,1148,1109,1061,1055],"Oql306vd","invisi-leafs","8w0NARqR","InvisiLeafs","Makes leaves easier to see through (more invisible) to help you find stuff like trail ruins easier :)","# InvisiLeafs!\n\nA small resource pack that deletes 50% of the pixels of leaf textures, which makes them easier to see through, or: more **invis**ible ~~leaves~~ leafs!\n\n# Use Cases\n\nThis has a few uses:\n\n* It can be easier to navigate through forests and jungles without getting lost and easier to understand your surroundings because you can see more of it since the trees don't block as much of your view.\n* If you built a wall out of leaves for some reason and want to more easily make sure people can't see stuff through it that they're not supposed to.\n* It's easier to spot structures (like jungle temples or trail ruins, or maybe player-built bases) when flying above in the sky looking down.\n* It's easier to spot all the logs inside trees to get rid of them when cutting them down.\n\n# Culling\n\nUnfortunately, in vanilla leaf block faces are rendered (not culled) inside other leaf blocks and that can't be disabled with a resource pack (at least not as far as I know). That effectively stacks the leaf texture multiple times for multiple-block-thick blobs of leaves (like trees), and so on its own this pack only helps a little bit. For the best experience, use a mod that culls those faces, such as:\n* [Cull Less Leaves](https://modrinth.com/mod/cull-less-leaves) with a depth of 1\n* [Cull Leaves](https://modrinth.com/mod/cull-leaves)\n* OptiFine's Smart Leaves\n\n# Smart Lighting\n\nBecause the inside of trees is somewhat dark and there's non-air blocks (leaves) surrounding the logs, they actually get rendered in shadow from smooth lighting. This can look a bit strange and can make it a bit trickier to see through the leaves, particularly for jungle shrubs (those clumps of leaves on the grounds in jungles). If this bothers you, you can turn smooth lighting off and they won't get rendered in shadow anymore (instead it will only rely on block light levels to determine shading, which are only slightly darker).","2023-07-13T23:04:53.798565Z","2023-07-14T08:33:00.574631Z","2023-07-16T01:16:16.736187Z","2023-07-14T11:14:34.384999Z",{"id":31055,"name":31056,"url":3604},"CC-BY-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International",5966,8,[113,303,307],[15,57,300],[377],[31063],"yKS4LaNb","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/6598e29266dc57da244f2da074a67d2044cc037c.png",[],[31067,31073,31079,31086,31092],{"url":31068,"raw_url":31069,"featured":861,"title":31070,"description":31071,"created":31072,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/30e2d7c1a8ccc907155887104dabf6405574bf95_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/bed36e80d3fd2a27867894b4280e80137a28c824.png","Comparison","Shows a comparison between vanilla (default) and InvisiLeafs in a jungle biome with a trail ruin. It's much easier to see with InvisiLeafs.","2023-07-14T07:52:18.854668Z",{"url":31074,"raw_url":31075,"featured":439,"title":31076,"description":31077,"created":31078,"ordering":30158},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/597ffdd3ce6a787e75484d8dfadab6812e3c4b98_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/597ffdd3ce6a787e75484d8dfadab6812e3c4b98.png","House Without InvisiLeafs","Without InvisiLeafs, you can't see the house behind the trees. A few pixels are visible poking through the leaves, but you wouldn't notice them unless you zoomed-in and even if you did you wouldn't know what those pixels are.","2023-07-14T08:04:23.480027Z",{"url":31080,"raw_url":31081,"featured":439,"title":31082,"description":31083,"created":31084,"ordering":31085},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/9046b247f1cac44cc868937eb1eb28c3c2838f0a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/9046b247f1cac44cc868937eb1eb28c3c2838f0a.png","House with InvisiLeafs","With InvisiLeafs, you can see there is a house behind the trees that you otherwise would've missed from this angle.","2023-07-14T08:07:20.922118Z",11,{"url":31087,"raw_url":31088,"featured":439,"title":31089,"description":31090,"created":31091,"ordering":30728},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/5d85dd9b41e997e5402889e1326084bab607efed_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/5d85dd9b41e997e5402889e1326084bab607efed.png","Smooth Lighting ON","With Smooth Lighting ON, blocks inside leaves are rendered in shadow, making them hard to see.","2023-07-14T07:55:00.808174Z",{"url":31093,"raw_url":31094,"featured":439,"title":31095,"description":31096,"created":31097,"ordering":31098},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/4b4848b8414be12bc6194dac289d50848cf8c538_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Oql306vd/images/4b4848b8414be12bc6194dac289d50848cf8c538.png","Smooth Lighting OFF","With Smooth Lighting OFF, blocks inside leaves are no longer rendered in shadow, making them easier to see (such as the red terracotta here).","2023-07-14T07:55:55.455917Z",21,1730820,{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29934,"game_versions":31101,"id":31102,"slug":31103,"project_type":12,"team":31104,"organization":3604,"title":31105,"description":31106,"body":31107,"body_url":3604,"published":31108,"updated":31109,"approved":31110,"queued":31111,"status":29922,"requested_status":29925,"moderator_message":3604,"license":31112,"downloads":31113,"followers":30063,"categories":31114,"additional_categories":31115,"loaders":31116,"versions":31117,"icon_url":31119,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":31120,"donation_urls":31121,"gallery":31125,"color":31177,"thread_id":31178,"monetization_status":29963},[2348],"Os6KbVYO","ying-yang-16x","vWuadKex","Ying Yang 16x","Bedwarr's 200 Subscriber Texture Pack","# Ying Yang [16x] PVP Resource/Texture Pack\n\n**Version**: 1.8.9  \n**Purpose**: Designed for PVP gameplay  \n**Author**: [iSadd](https://www.youtube.com/saddypacks)  \n**Commissioned by**: [Bedwarr](https://youtube.com/bedwarr) for reaching 200 Subscribers  \n**Release Date**: June 25, 2021\n\n### ✅ What It Does\nYing Yang [16x] is a custom resource/texture pack that enhances the visual experience for PVP players on Minecraft version 1.8.9. It offers high-quality, performance-optimized textures that bring a cohesive and unique look to your gameplay. Whether you're battling in Bedwars or other PVP modes, this pack ensures your game looks great without sacrificing framerate.\n\n### Why You Should Download It\n- **Connected Textures**: Leverages [OptiFine's](https://optifine.net/home) mcpatcher to create seamless, connected textures, adding depth and realism to the game.\n- **Unified Aesthetics**: Features matching sword, tool, and armor textures for a consistent and polished visual style.\n- **Optimized Performance**: 16x16 pixel textures strike a balance between quality and performance, making it ideal for PVP where every frame counts.\n- **Exclusive Armor**: Includes armor textures adapted from [Lunar [16x]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=24nKfNb-PMU), adding a touch of exclusivity to your character.\n- **Custom 'Vanilla-like' Textures**: Preserves the feel of the original Minecraft experience while providing a fresh visual upgrade.\n\n### Critical Information Before Downloading\nTo fully experience the connected textures feature, ensure you have [OptiFine](https://optifine.net/home) installed. This pack is specifically designed for Minecraft 1.8.9, so compatibility with other versions is not guaranteed.\n\n### Video Preview\nExperience Ying Yang [16x] in action by watching the following video:\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/pKoo8xw4iCU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>","2024-08-26T07:16:13.454369Z","2024-08-26T07:18:08.847805Z","2024-08-28T21:50:45.792069Z","2024-08-28T09:33:30.274346Z",{"id":30061,"name":10,"url":3604},3247,[57,77,292],[15,113,148,197],[377],[31118],"O6TTXBoE","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os6KbVYO/c57161343145b3a243ada7d74a6a78f3ea661bfc_96.webp","https://discord.gg/xWajYcE8K6",[31122],{"id":3152,"platform":31123,"url":31124},"Bmac","https://buymeacoffee.com/bedwarr",[31126,31131,31136,31141,31146,31151,31156,31161,31166,31171],{"url":31127,"raw_url":31128,"featured":439,"title":31129,"description":3604,"created":31130,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os6KbVYO/images/47fcebf0e17a4628e91f3a53da2ef8dd871e48ac_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os6KbVYO/images/47fcebf0e17a4628e91f3a53da2ef8dd871e48ac.png","Sunset Sky","2024-08-26T07:43:07.601113Z",{"url":31132,"raw_url":31133,"featured":439,"title":31134,"description":3604,"created":31135,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os6KbVYO/images/4c69b9422d295a090b1103ba2140b10b43374d86_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os6KbVYO/images/4c69b9422d295a090b1103ba2140b10b43374d86.png","Night Sky","2024-08-26T07:43:15.317873Z",{"url":31137,"raw_url":31138,"featu