KR8","supernova-empires-2","WeSJpVlw","Supernova Empires 2","A Totaly reformed modpack from the previous, based on ProjectE and with other mods","This is my new modpack it's based on ProjectE (like the others), but with some limitations, it's a bit difficult to craft items.\n\nNow you can have a lot of security thanks to Securitycraft with provindes a reinforced set of blocks, You can troll your friends with Securitycraft mines and a lot's of other things.\nWe will guide you from start to finish based on quests, enjoy all the upgrades from vanilla items and your rewards.\nWe hope you enjoy the Draconic Evolution With aditional difficulty and Refined + Reborn Storage for your craftings.\nWe teach how to use roost and get your items.\n\nThis modpack have an extra quests (kill entities) for more fun, hope you enjoy your hunting time.\n\n## Mod Copyright Atribution:\n\n- LunatriusCore: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lunatriuscore\n- LootBags: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootbags\n- Baubles: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baubles\n- Reskillable: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reskillable\n\n[![Partners](https://i.imgur.com/5z7G7f9.png)](https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2758)","2023-03-24T19:48:02.461366Z","2023-07-03T13:41:04.873431Z","2023-06-19T00:42:46.142248Z","2023-06-17T15:58:51.533596Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":3604},145631,[30,77,171],[200,240],[354],[31249,31250],"jLoKPKOO","ndm0obMO","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Or9UFKR8/3d8cd38857904e17b7949f598c0a6ad2278b21de_96.webp","https://github.com/FilmaBem2/Supernova-Empires-2/issues","https://github.com/FilmaBem2/Supernova-Empires-2","https://filmabem.notion.site/Supernova-Empires-Wiki-18010225aa2b4b30ac6beacc6ad441a4",[31256],{"id":3164,"platform":3165,"url":31257},"https://revolut.me/luis4gz85",[],1063237,{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29934,"game_versions":31261,"id":31262,"slug":31263,"project_type":12,"team":31264,"organization":360