ed":31345,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":31346,"downloads":31347,"followers":29950,"categories":31348,"additional_categories":31349,"loaders":31350,"versions":31351,"icon_url":31355,"issues_url":31356,"source_url":31357,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":31358,"donation_urls":31359,"gallery":31360,"color":31361,"thread_id":31362,"monetization_status":29963},[1055,859],"OrfyB15G","rekusaeater","cjSC5csa","ReKusaEater","A meme mod based on Bocchi The Rock, adds edible grass.\nThe 1.20.1 version","# KUSA\nThis mod adds edibles to grass.\n1. The grass can be crafted with the vanilla grass \n1. The default saturation & hunger value is a litter less to that of carrots\n\n# 艹\n本模组增加了可以吃的草。\n1. 本模组的草可以使用原版的草合成。\n1. 默认饱和度&饥饿值比胡萝卜较低。","2024-07-25T11:32:44.499896Z","2024-07-26T14:47:04.763532Z","2024-07-25T21:07:44.900163Z","2024-07-25T11:42:48.099477Z",{"id":30196,"name":30197,"url":3604},746,[131],[],[346,354,385],[31352,31353,31354],"W4VpziH7","cDRB0tLT","StzarCEY","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrfyB15G/e9093bd7e8bf4bfa01c1ac0e107e5fbebe6363cf_96.webp","https://github.com/Yuqi154/ReKusaEater/issues","https://github.com/Yuqi154/ReKusaEater","https://discord.gg/jSCN3W3D",[],[],4154166,"T22NZWw2",{"client_side":29934,"server_side":29935,"game_versions":31364,"id":31365,"slug":31366,"project_type":31,"team":31367,"organization":31368,"title":31369,"description":31370,"body":31371,"body_url":3604,"published":31372,"updated":31373,"approved":31374,"queued":31375,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":31376,"downloads":31377,"followers":29950,"categories":31378,"additional_categories":31379,"loaders":31380,"versions":31381,"icon_url":31389,"issues_url":31390,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":31391,"discord_url":31390,"donation_urls":31392,"gallery":31395,"color":31405,"thread_id":31406,"monetization_status":29963},[2546,2528,2504,2501,2495,2492,2489,2486,2483,2348,2297,2285,2282,2258,2255,2237,2234,2231,2183,2177,2174,2117,2108,2099,1940,1916,1907,1790,1781,1766,1751,1727,1658,1652,1643,1553,1550,1520,1514,1502,1481,1406,1388,1325,1310,1283,1226,1193,1184,1148,1109,1061,1055,1022,980,974,902,896,859,853,805,802,772,724,682],"OryL7rBG","solvermotd","PDFILs54","a4uGMkS1","SolverMOTD","Just a simple motd plugin","[![FyrxLab Server Invite](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/872bd66ffb373091ac642dd73db3813f42563f7c.png)](https://discord.gg/qe6cxbfW8s)\n![SolverMotd Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b306eaa17a4ce31f56d52225cc9dd93143aac359.png)\n![Intro](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/45617eb59d3b01f43640cad0b944c8411abbc531.png)\n\n**SolverMOTD** is a plugin for Spigot servers that allows server owners to display a customized welcome message (MOTD) with a uniform format. The plugin supports color codes, dynamic placeholders through PlaceholderAPI, and **MiniMessage** formatting.\n\nServer administrators can use features like hot reload to change the MOTD without restarting the server. It supports placeholders like %server_online%, %time%, and more, making server list customization simple and flexible.\n\nSolverMOTD provides a centralized configuration, with easy-to-use commands. The plugin offers straightforward customization for Minecraft server owners looking to personalize their server's first impression.\n\n![installation](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/426b0763c4487a7f27a7991fe6c4dedea43e835e.png)\n![InstallAndSetup](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/20c18118536913d83eeb0637deab6ea0531348ba.png)\n\n![config](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/97e5aed6a9ed1c3e8f20ffc538658332d1cab8c0.png)\n\n```yaml\n# ███████╗ ██████╗ ██╗     ██╗   ██╗███████╗██████╗\n# ██╔════╝██╔═══██╗██║     ██║   ██║██╔════╝██╔══██╗\n# ███████╗██║   ██║██║     ██║   ██║█████╗  ██████╔╝\n# ╚════██║██║   ██║██║     ██║   ██║██╔══╝  ██╔══██╗\n# ███████║╚██████╔╝███████╗╚██████╔╝███████╗██║  ██║\n# ╚══════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚══════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝\n## ──────────────────────────── TEMPLATES ──────────────────────────── ##\n## These are templates that you can use as your server's MOTD,\n## make sure to customize them as best suits your community.\n## Template 1:\n## motd:\n##   line1: \"§r   §6§lSolverCraft§r §6§lNetwork§8§l §8┃┃ §b§lSKYBLOCK §f§lUPDATE§r\"\n##   line2: \"§e   example§l.§ecom §71.8-1.21 §8┃┃ §fInfo: §7jeam§l.§7one/solvermotd\"\n## Template 2:\n## motd:\n##   line1: \"§r       §6§lSOLVERCRA§e§lFT NE§6§lTWORK §8(§71.8 - 1.21§8)§r\"\n##   line2: \"§r           §6§l¡BOXPVP! §7Available §fNow!§7.\"\n## Template 3:\n## motd:\n##   line1: \"§f        『§l SOLVER§e§lCRAFT§e 』§6§l(§e1.8 - 1.21.x§6§l)§r\"\n##   line2: \"          §a§l§n¡COME MAKE GREAT FRIENDS!\"\n\nmotd:\n  line1: \u003Ccolor:#ffe45e>SolverMOTD\u003C/color> Best Motd Plugin\n  line2: '\u003Cyellow>\u003Cgradient:#5e4fa2:#f79459>Edit your Config.yml File!\u003C/gradient>!'\n\nuse_papi: true\nuse_minimessage: true\n\n```\n\n    \n## Commands\n\n    /smotd reload: Reloads the plugin's configuration.\n\n    /smotd help: Displays the list of available commands.\n\n## Permissions\n\n    solvermotd.reload: Allows the use of /smotd reload.\n\n\n\n\n","2025-03-11T05:19:08.080863Z","2026-07-08T19:59:08.591919Z","2025-03-13T03:21:25.682593Z","2025-03-11T07:55:09.619782Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":3604},466,[175],[303],[329,334,350,401,405,417,428,432],[31382,31383,31384,31385,31386,31387,31388],"S2ZekZfQ","KNr3R72j","22xyfs4y","UFm2NNSi","qtfUulBA","uzzKe1Eq","E2cVe93X","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OryL7rBG/a56aee434f184454f26b90bbbc6167758d960643_96.webp","https://discord.gg/qe6cxbfW8s","https://jeamcube.com/docs/solvermotd/",[31393],{"id":3152,"platform":31123,"url":31394},"https://buymeacoffee.com/jeam",[31396,31401],{"url":31397,"raw_url":31398,"featured":861,"title":31399,"description":3604,"created":31400,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OryL7rBG/images/2c736b39d87fafe214cb53731a1221b9adc04a66_350.webp","