iomes O' Plenty and Dungeons and Taverns mod. But do not think you are safe in this world. The overworld and caves are littered with Midnight Lurkers and you can catch a few structures and glimpses to the infamous Herobrine. Tales tell of a Man From the Fog and the One Who Watches. Cave Dwellers are scattered throughout the night and in the dark and dense caves. Things are even more stressful with the Tense Ambience mod. In this bizarre place you can see glimpses of past explorers and friends. Survival is the most important thing, but make sure not to do too many bad things, or the god will make sure you don't see another day. Many ways your journey can lay out, what about yours? ","2025-03-04T05:25:00.916937Z","2025-08-23T02:18:57.565575Z","2025-03-10T03:24:51.332873Z","2025-03-04T05:35:23.156381Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":3604},1419,[30,171,200],[],[354],[32097,32098,32099,32100,32101,32102,32103,32104,32105],"kZHLc0Bx","n2E4cU4x","F9LQVAxx","BXpNILrj","3ZrCI37o","lD43LAfa","xwTVEQ49","N8tnGxym","Jq9xOMfC","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsSJzKYN/da2f65eba2b2ba5bc7da01eebdec7f29fcc95899.png",[32108],{"id":3164,"platform":3165,"url":32109},"https://www.youtube.com/@skippy_wampy",[32111],{"url":32112,"raw_url":32113,"featured":439,"title":32114,"description":3604,"created":32115,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsSJzKYN/images/e76c6e592446f5fca51c5e95ad63990bb3d75aed_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OsSJzKYN/images/e76c6e592446f5fca51c5e95ad63990bb3d75aed.png","With My Friend","2025-03-04T05:34:24.741452Z",1908009,"x0p1D9de",{"client_side":29934,"server_side":29935,"game_versions":32119,"id":32120,"slug":32121,"project_type":31,"team":32122,"organization":3604,"title":32123,"description":32124,"body":32125,"body_url":3604,"published":32126,"updated":32127,"approved":32128,"queued":32129,"status":29922,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3604,"license":32130,"downloads":30728,"followers":29950,"categories":32131,"additional_categories":32132,"loaders":32133,"versions":32134,"icon_url":32136,"issues_url":3604,"source_url":3604,"wiki_url":3604,"discord_url":3604,"donation_urls":32137,"gallery":32138,"color":32147,"thread_id":32148,"monetization_status":29963},[2546,2528,2504,2501,2495,2492,2489,2486,2483,2348,2297,2285,2282,2258,2255,2237,2234,2231,2183,2177,2174,2117,2108,2099,1940,1916,1907,1790,1781,1766,1751,1727,1658,1652,1643,1553,1550,1520,1514,1502,1481,1406,1388,1325,1310,1283,1226,1193,1184,1148,1109,1061,1055,1022,980,974,902,896,859,853,805,802,772,724,682,673,667,622,616,571,517,511,499,450],"Os7ZexQs","shotcrete","dNqJylRJ","Shotcrete","Place floating sand & gravel and stop chain-reaction falls. | 9 languages","A lightweight SpigotMC plugin that allows players to place sand and gravel in mid-air. When enabled, these blocks ignore gravity and remain stationary even when surrounding blocks are destroyed.\n\n## **Sand & Gravel Stabilization**\n\n* **Gravity Protection:** When a player with the feature enabled places sand or gravel, the block is temporarily protected internally, disabling its gravity.\n* **Chain Propagation:** The protection isn't limited to newly placed blocks. If a block adjacent to any sand or gravel is destroyed, the plugin automatically detects and protects the remaining blocks, preventing a collapse. This ensures that even pre-existing structures remain suspended when their support is removed.\n* **Piston Compatibility:** Protected blocks can be pushed or pulled by pistons just like normal blocks. The anti-gravity protection stays active even after the block has been moved to its new position.\n* **Normal Mode:** Disables gravity for **Sand, Suspicious Sand, Red Sand, Gravel,** and **Suspicious Gravel.**\n* **Advanced Mode:** In addition to Normal Mode, gravity is disabled for **Anvils, Dragon Eggs, Concrete Powder,** and **Scaffolding.**\n\n## **Multilingual Support**\n\n* **Supports 9 languages:** 日本語, English, 简体中文, 한국어, Español, Português, Русский, Deutsch, Français\n* The system automatically detects the player's Minecraft client language and displays messages in the corresponding language.\n* For unsupported languages, the server's default language will be used. You can configure this in `config.yml` under the language setting (setting it to `auto` will automatically detect the language based on the server's OS).\n* Players can also manually set their language using the `/shotcrete lang` command. These individual settings will persist even after a server restart.\n\n## **Commands**\n\n* `/shotcrete` – Toggles the stabilization feature on/off (Normal Mode).\n* `/shotcrete advanced` – Toggles the stabilization feature on/off (Advanced Mode).\n* `/shotcrete lang` – Changes your language (ja, en, zh, ko, es, pt, ru, de, fr).\n* `/shotcrete lang reset` – Clears the manual language setting and reverts to automatic detection.","2026-05-12T15:08:29.949876Z","2026-05-12T15:13:30.736384Z","2026-05-13T02:12:22.842192Z","2026-05-12T15:16:53.777608Z",{"id":30061,"name":10,"url":3604},[303],[],[350,401,417],[32135],"EvourypC","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os7ZexQs/e6cc6cca4488bfba68c6bd2320acdda2c3eaf408_96.webp",[],[32139,32143],{"url":32140,"raw_url":32141,"featured":439,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":32142,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os7ZexQs/images/4b03694e6209231bae9d66bbcc77430f678e9b07_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os7ZexQs/images/4b03694e6209231bae9d66bbcc77430f678e9b07.jpeg","2026-05-12T15:15:23.721678Z",{"url":32144,"raw_url":32145,"featured":439,"title":3604,"description":3604,"created":32146,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os7ZexQs/images/e205ede95ed4c5b67249e07d64af5e89a1651ff8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Os7ZexQs/images/e205ede95ed4c5b67249e07d64af5e89a1651ff8.jpeg","2026-05-12T15:15:34.910621Z",8747618,"A103tjFx",{"client_side":29935,"server_side":29934,"game_versions":32150,"id":32151,"slug":32152,"project_type":31,"team":32153,"organizatio