r=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n# That's it 🎯\n\nJust download the datapack (don't forget to give a fav) load it on your world and start placing blocks! You don't need any set-up or dependencies. MinhoCreates gives you quality just for you!\nIf you no longer need this project, just remove it from your datapack's folder.\n\nWorking on single-player, multi-player, vanilla, plugin-loaders, mod-loaders, realms. Experimental Features Free.\n\nAs time passes by we are going to add new effects and support for new blocks. If you want to contribute we would love hearing from you on our discord server.\n\nThis is the actual block list, for the newest version:\n\n- >         \"minecraft:amethyst_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:beacon\",\n- >         \"minecraft:cherry_leaves\",\n- >         \"minecraft:chiseled_tuff\",\n- >         \"minecraft:chiseled_tuff_bricks\",\n- >         \"minecraft:copper_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:diamond_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:emerald_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:enchanting_table\",\n- >         \"minecraft:gold_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:magma_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:netherite_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:polished_tuff\",\n- >         \"minecraft:redstone_block\",\n- >         \"minecraft:soul_sand\",\n- >         \"minecraft:soul_soil\",\n- >         \"minecraft:tuff\",\n- >         \"minecraft:tuff_bricks\"\n\n[![Discord invite](https://i.postimg.cc/wj8sRG16/joinus.gif)](https://discord.gg/MhEZ2sDncV)\n\n","2025-11-08T23:38:04.540211Z","2026-04-30T20:51:52.255668Z","2025-11-09T07:21:20.172031Z","2025-11-09T02:18:44.093420Z",{"id":30061,"name":10,"url":3604},2413,[100,134,171],[],[342,346,354,385,409],[32306,32307,32308,32309],"nXf9Xzmv","qT2lLXI3","FV87J16j","raJC3Wgi","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OriPFqmG/54076703697b5152fb8b227646cf0c2a854d993a_96.webp","https://discord.gg/MhEZ