s://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/images/f816fc4fc348392da52cb9e3b8ca1177005e3084.png)\n- Paste that location into the 'Track Specific World' Setting in AATool\n  \n  ![AATool setting location](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/images/f393a45c038a682438512d2eb17ea1c78c5a614c.png)\n- If tracking successfully, you will see the following:\n  \n  ![AATool bottom indicator showing \"Tracking: 'aaproxy'\"](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/images/2a174d9d5ea2eb33accc598b0b501a626f689d0b.png)\n\n**You only need to do this one time; on the first server you join.**\n\n## Config\n- Enable / disable the proxy with F6 (rebindable in controls)\n- Or in Mod menu config screen\n  ![Mod menu config options](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/images/9bf9b9b2f8f645ce257072db79fc93e8a86ae885.png)\n  ","2025-01-12T02:07:17.238291Z","2025-10-29T23:20:31.282009Z","2025-01-14T22:09:07.777806Z","2025-01-12T03:43:13.476545Z",{"id":29947,"name":29948,"url":32627},"https://github.com/red-stoned/aaproxy/blob/master/LICENSE",420,[134,303],[175,288],[346],[32633,32634],"wYB76903","WRUYrVEi","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/740ae42e551c8f7711c57af9080ca3b26beb73c8.png","https://github.com/red-stoned/aaproxy/issues","https://github.com/red-stoned/aaproxy",[],[32640,32644,32649,32654],{"url":32641,"raw_url":32641,"featured":439,"title":32642,"description":3604,"created":32643,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/images/2a174d9d5ea2eb33accc598b0b501a626f689d0b.png","Tracking Successfully","2025-01-12T03:27:35.789163Z",{"url":32645,"raw_url":32646,"featured":439,"title":32647,"description":3604,"created":32648,"ordering":29950},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/images/9bf9b9b2f8f645ce257072db79fc93e8a86ae885_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OrPmMrPW/images/9bf9b9b2f8f645ce257072db79fc93e8a86ae885.png","mod menu config","2025-01-12T03:38:08.170457Z",{"url":32650,"raw_url":32651,"featured":439,"title":32652,"description":3604,"created":32653,"ord